# The loopback tests' certificates and keys, made with OpenSSL 4.1 on
# 2026-11-16 in a scratch folder that is not kept, and kept here as text, so
# that no test needs a tool or a network.
# They are test data and nothing else: every key below is public.

# The test authority's certificate, EC on P-256, `CN=Heroes Test Root`,
# valid from 2019-01-01 to 2125-12-31: the one root the loopback tests
# trust.
